<title>USA: ADM increases share repurchase plan.</title>
<headline>ADM increases share repurchase plan.</headline>
<dateline>DECATUR, Ill. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Archer Daniels Midland Co said Thursday its board of directors voted to extend its share repurchase program until October 1999 and to increase the amount of shares to be repurchased to 42 million from 25 million.</p>
<p>ADM said the repurchased stock will be used for acquisitions, contributions to company pension plans or for treasury stock.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
